{"seq":1,"slug":"three-way-match-model","title":"三单匹配模型：PO/收货单/发票","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/accounts-payable-invoice-automation/matching-approval/three-way-match-model","wordCount":2831,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"三单匹配模型-po-收货单-发票\">三单匹配模型：PO/收货单/发票</h1><p>跨境电商的应付账款之所以难自动化，根子在履约链条太长：采购下单在 ERP，收货发生在海外仓或第三方 3PL，发票由境外供应商用另一套格式寄来，三者可能分属三个系统、三种时间、三种货币。&quot;三单匹配&quot;（three-way match）就是把这三份证据对齐成一条可以付款的结论——但它不是简单的字段比对，而是一个带容差、带例外处置、带幂等重放的<strong>核对引擎</strong>。本篇讲清楚匹配什么、为什么会有差异、容差怎么定，以及如何把它建模成一个能扛住现实脏数据的工程组件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>三单匹配的&quot;三单&quot;指三份相互独立的凭证：<strong>采购订单 PO</strong>（我们想买什么、什么价）、<strong>收货单 GRN/GR</strong>（我们实际收到什么），以及<strong>供应商发票 INV</strong>（对方要求我们付什么）。三者的关系可用一个恒等式概括：付款的前提是&quot;发票金额&quot;与&quot;我们认可的收货价值&quot;一致，而后者又必须落在 PO 授权的范围内。任何一环脱节，就产生差异（discrepancy）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[采购订单 PO&lt;br/&gt;授权数量 + 单价 + 条款] --&gt; D{三单匹配引擎}&#10;  B[收货单 GRN&lt;br/&gt;实测数量 + 收货日期] --&gt; D&#10;  C[供应商发票 INV&lt;br/&gt;开票金额 + 税 + 币种] --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E{全部在容差内?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[自动匹配&lt;br/&gt;AUTO_MATCHED]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[例外队列&lt;br/&gt;EXCEPTION]&#10;  F --&gt; H[进入付款审批流]&#10;  G --&gt; I{可容忍差异?}&#10;  I --&gt;|是 且 授权| J[人工放行&lt;br/&gt;MANUAL_OVERRIDE]&#10;  I --&gt;|否| K[退回供应商&lt;br/&gt;DISPUTED]&#10;  J --&gt; H&#10;  K --&gt; L[重开票 / 冲销&lt;br/&gt;REINVOICE]&#10;  L --&gt; C\">graph TD\n  A[采购订单 PO&lt;br/&gt;授权数量 + 单价 + 条款] --&gt; D{三单匹配引擎}\n  B[收货单 GRN&lt;br/&gt;实测数量 + 收货日期] --&gt; D\n  C[供应商发票 INV&lt;br/&gt;开票金额 + 税 + 币种] --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E{全部在容差内?}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[自动匹配&lt;br/&gt;AUTO_MATCHED]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[例外队列&lt;br/&gt;EXCEPTION]\n  F --&gt; H[进入付款审批流]\n  G --&gt; I{可容忍差异?}\n  I --&gt;|是 且 授权| J[人工放行&lt;br/&gt;MANUAL_OVERRIDE]\n  I --&gt;|否| K[退回供应商&lt;br/&gt;DISPUTED]\n  J --&gt; H\n  K --&gt; L[重开票 / 冲销&lt;br/&gt;REINVOICE]\n  L --&gt; C</pre><p>为什么是三单而非两单？若只用 PO 对发票（two-way match），系统无法发现&quot;钱付了、货没到&quot;——跨境场景里供应商虚开或货物在途丢失都可能发生，两单匹配会照付。加上收货单，才能回答&quot;这笔钱对应的货物我们真的签收了吗&quot;；反过来只用 PO 对收货单则漏掉价格与税。业界内控框架（如 COSO 内控框架、<a href=\"https://www.aicpa-cima.com/\">AICPA</a> 的采购付款循环指引）都把三单匹配列为关键控制点：它同时防住重复付款、超付与虚假发票。</p>\n<p>下表把三单各自携带的关键字段和它们在匹配中的角色对齐：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>采购订单 PO</th>\n<th>收货单 GRN</th>\n<th>供应商发票 INV</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心问题</td>\n<td>我们授权买什么</td>\n<td>我们实际收到什么</td>\n<td>对方要求我们付什么</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键字段</td>\n<td>PO 号、行号、单价、数量、币种、付款条款</td>\n<td>PO 号、收货行、实收数量、收货日期、批次</td>\n<td>发票号、发票日期、金额、税、币种、PO 引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数量权威</td>\n<td>授权上限</td>\n<td>实际发生</td>\n<td>计费依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格权威</td>\n<td>合同锁定价</td>\n<td>不涉及</td>\n<td>供应商主张价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间权威</td>\n<td>下单时间</td>\n<td>收货时间</td>\n<td>开票时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨境特殊点</td>\n<td>贸易术语（FOB/CIF）决定谁付运费</td>\n<td>关税、进口增值税确认</td>\n<td>常含预扣税、代垫运费</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三单在时间上通常错位：PO 最先，收货在中，发票最后（也可能先到）。因此匹配引擎必须支持<strong>发票先到、货未到</strong>（待匹配）、<strong>货到票未到</strong>（预估负债 accrual）、以及<strong>部分收货分次开票</strong>等真实时序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"匹配算法与容差模型\">匹配算法与容差模型</h2><p>匹配的第一层是<strong>键（key）解析</strong>。发票上通常只有 PO 号，没有收货单号，引擎要先靠 PO 号把三单串起来；若供应商漏写 PO 号，就要靠供应商 + 金额 + 日期做模糊匹配，或退回人工。键可靠之后，才轮到逐行比对。</p>\n<p>逐维度的比对逻辑可以形式化为：对某一行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span>，设 PO 授权数量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q^{po}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0592em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7823em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、授权单价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^{po}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0592em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7823em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，收货实收数量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q^{gr}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0592em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7823em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，发票数量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q^{inv}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0833em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、单价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^{inv}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0833em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。则数量差异与金额差异为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta q_i = q^{inv}_i - q^{gr}_i, \\qquad \\Delta p_i = p^{inv}_i - p^{po}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1217em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8747em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0592em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7823em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1217em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8747em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0592em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7823em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>是否落在容差内，通常同时看绝对值和百分比两条线：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>pass</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><msubsup><mi>τ</mi><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msubsup><mtext> 或 </mtext><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msubsup></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><msubsup><mi>τ</mi><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msubsup></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><msubsup><mi>τ</mi><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{pass}_i \\iff \\left(|\\Delta q_i| \\le \\tau^{abs}_q \\ \\text{或}\\ \\frac{|\\Delta q_i|}{q^{po}_i} \\le \\tau^{pct}_q\\right) \\ \\land\\ \\frac{|\\Delta p_i|}{p^{po}_i} \\le \\tau^{pct}_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7691em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pass</span></span